  "content": "<p>这是原版模组 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glazed-symmetry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glazed Symmetry</a> 的一个端口转发版本，由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/iamevn_mc/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">iamevn_mc</a> 制作。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;未来的计划中，将根据时间允许添加额外的台阶、楼梯和墙壁。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>添加了来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.reddit.com/r/Minecraft/comments/5v7h92/centered_terracotta_tiles_snapshot_17w06a/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.reddit.com/r/Minecraft/comments/5v7h92/centered_terracotta_tiles_snapshot_17w06a/</a> 的居中陶瓦砖块，以及一种具有可定向侧面的变体。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>在石切机上转换不同类型的釉陶：</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GDAjJHv.png\" alt=\"石切机配方\" width=\"400\" height=\"482\"></p>\n<h3>方块</h3>\n<div><a rel=\"nofollow\">剧透（点击隐藏）</a></div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"display:block\">\n<p>第一行是侧向柱，第二行是直立柱，第三行是居中，第四行是原版。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZG5exsX.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"347\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JU5H0x5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"347\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AGT4M1x.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"347\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Bo9aEbY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"347\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h3>几种图案：</h3>\n<div><a rel=\"nofollow\">剧透（点击隐藏）</a></div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"display:block\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V4WvmHq.png\" alt=\"更好的奇数尺寸铺设！\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tJmoj4K.png\" alt=\"更好的奇数尺寸铺设！\" width=\"640\" height=\"347\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4aAsN9E.png\" alt=\"奇数尺寸的图案！\" width=\"641\" height=\"347\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/00NI281.png\" alt=\"釉陶柱\" width=\"640\" height=\"347\"></p>\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
